WEBVTT

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.860
Notice

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.990
New Loot Boxes
New Items

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.070
Yggdrasil Series

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.070
New Items at a Glance

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.530
1st: Fairy Illusion

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.660
2nd: Yggdrasil Series

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.990
3rd: Flare Tunic

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:37.990
4th: Fairy Headband
5th: Fairy Choker
6th: Fairy Bracelet

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.080
How cute.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.990
The stuff in the loot boxes
is great this time.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.500
FdM Points

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.500
150% Campaign

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.500
Buy now and get half your points
<b>as an added bonus!</b>

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.500
And there's even a bonus
point campaign right now.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.990
Playing with plastic, huh?

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:53.250
It'd mean cutting into my savings,
so I'm not really that gung-ho about it.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:56.260
But on the other hand...

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.050
Would you become my partner?

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.330
Life's been looking up lately,

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.350
so what's a little splurging here and there?

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:13.070
Sounds good to me!

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.740
Wow, it's all so cute!

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.860
I bet Lily-chan's gonna give it a spin.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.740
I wonder Kanbe thinks

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:30.610
about Lily-chan and Hayashi-kun
becoming partners.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.760
I'm jealous. Partners, huh?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.260
Episode 4

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.260
Like a Maiden in Love

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:44.260
Fujimoto-kun, do you have a moment?

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:45.340
Yes.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:50.140
Furuya-san said she'd fill
in for you this Wednesday.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.390
Really? That's a relief!

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.770
You have a job interview,
right? Do your best!

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:55.520
I will!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:59.310
Oh, but if you graduate
and find a full-time job,

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.530
you'll quit your job here, won't you?

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:05.660
It's okay if you bomb the interview, too.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.410
That's really not funny! Give me a break!

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:11.780
Oh, come on! It was just a joke.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.420
Look at the time.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.420
I'm going to step out for a minute.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.170
Can you take that off at 2?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.930
Electronic Money Maintenance

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.930
Oh, so maintenance was today?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:26.170
Well, it's not really such a big deal
that we needed to put a sign up.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.900
The only people who ever
buy electronic money here

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.810
are you and that, you know, meek—

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.850
Welcome!

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.890
Goodness, speak of the devil.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.870
I'll be right back.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:38.690
Take care.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.050
Welcome.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.210
I'd like this, too.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.910
I'm sorry. The electronic money service
is currently undergoing maintenance,

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.360
so we can't process any transactions.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.220
Electronic Money Maintenance

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.220
Never mind, then.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:14.730
Oh, but the maintenance should
be finished in about five minutes.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:20.230
Then do you mind if I wait here?

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.360
Feel free!

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:39.590
Actually, there's a bonus point
campaign going on right now.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.680
Sorry. I thought if I didn't bring it up now,

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.930
I wouldn't ever get the chance to.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.890
I play, too. <i>Fruits de Mer</i>, I mean.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.950
That's why I was always
a bit curious about you.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.400
Can you confirm the amount
of funds you'd like to buy?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.120
Y-Yes!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.540
Is this for the new loot boxes?

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.150
Mm! Yeah, yeah!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.060
It's a great lineup this time, isn't it?

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.040
I plan to give it a spin when I get home, too.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.160
The first place loot is cutesy,
which I'm not really interested in.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.600
But the second place weapon skin
is pretty interesting.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.030
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.670
I guess I have a tendency
to ramble about this stuff.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.430
No! P-P-Please, go on!

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:31.180
I-I-I was also thinking of getting
some items from the loot—

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.300
I need some smokes.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.650
Sure! The usual?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:37.060
You know it!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.870
What timing!

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.730
I'm just in the way now, so I'll head home.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:45.970
Miss!

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.100
Come again!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:02.340
What a shock! What a shock!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.140
I didn't say anything weird, right?
I'm fine, right?

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:09.340
Ah, but I'm not wearing makeup
and I look like a total mess!

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:18.510
Still, that was the first time I've gotten
to talk to someone about MMOs in real life.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.480
Kanbe-san! Did you see the official site?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.250
Yeah, sure did.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.990
The loot boxes are pretty good this time.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.030
I know, right?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.400
I went right out and bought a
bunch of points with web money.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:37.030
I bet even the bottom tier prizes
will still sell for a lot. It'll be great.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.290
What a shrewd businessman.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:44.000
Lilac-san! What are you doing over there?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.210
What's going on, Lilac?

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.900
So you spotted me.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:52.670
I was hoping to surprise you.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.890
That fluffy gradient! It's the Flare Tunic!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.300
And that flying butterfly effect!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.890
Don't tell me you dropped
a bunch of money on that.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.530
Heh heh, I sure did!

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.340
It's super cute, Lilac-san!

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:12.620
Man, how much did that all cost you?

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.880
Jeez, why do you have to
ask questions like that?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.340
It's not right! You don't get girls at all!

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.050
Huh?

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:23.040
Take a hint from Hayashi-kun!
Just say it's cute! Come on!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.640
And why do I have to do something like that?

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:30.310
Now, now... I'm sure he feels
that way on the inside.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.930
He just can't express himself honestly.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.350
I didn't ask for your strange backup, Hayashi!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.660
Strange?

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.620
So, what?

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.900
"She's just a weirdo going on about
incomprehensible stuff like usual."

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.190
Is that what you were thinking?

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:41.880
Yup.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.880
Argh!

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.060
Gosh, Kanbe-san.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.190
Lilac:  Take a hint from Hayashi-kun! Just say it's cute! Come on!
Kanbe:  And why do I have to do something like that?
Hayashi:  Now, now... I'm sure he feels that way on the inside.
Hayashi:  He just can't express himself honestly.
Kanbe:  I didn't ask for your strange backup, Hayashi!!
Lilac:  Strange? So, what?
Lilac:  "She's just a weirdo going on about incomprehensible stuff like usual."
Lilac:  Is what you were thinking?
Kanbe:  Yup.
Lilac:  Argh!!!
Hayashi:  Gosh, Kanbe-san. Pokotarou-san has logged in.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.200
Hey!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.650
Good evening.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.750
Oh, Li-chan, I see you went
right for the loot boxes.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.960
Already done dying it?

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.450
It's a great color and matches your hair!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.230
It really suits you.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.550
Poko-chan, I give you full
points for the compliment...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:11.270
But who can see my new gear with your
big character standing over top of me?!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.090
Yeah?

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:18.840
So you put 10,000 yen into
it and got those two prizes?

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:21.090
You've got good luck as always.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.850
I hope I get lucky, too! I want the top prize.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:32.250
Hayashi-kun, how could you have said that?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.010
Once it catches wind of that, it's all over.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.090
Wh-What's "it"?!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.870
The greed sensor!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.460
Allow me to explain!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:49.200
The greed sensor is said to be a mechanic
that engages as soon as a player says

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:53.010
"I hope I get that rare drop"
and is consumed by greed!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.770
My loot boxes are done for...

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.050
Sorry, sorry. We're just teasing.

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.520
It'll be okay. Probably.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:12.030
Come on. I'll pray for
some good luck for you, too.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.510
Lilac-san...

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.030
Good evening, everyone!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.880
Hey!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.230
Good evening.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:25.790
Lily-chan, Hayashi-kun's
about to buy some loot boxes.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.170
Really?!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:27.940
Whoa!

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.170
Take me with you!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.170
Let's all try our luck!

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:35.910
Yeah!

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:47.550
Draw!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:50.470
Web money card!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.840
108th

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.840
Healing Potions

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:19.070
A miss. An utter failure.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.040
It's not even a new item
from the most recent update.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.350
Just regular old healing potions.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.050
Nothing less from Hayashi-kun!
He never lets you down.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:29.860
I mean... Don't let it get to you!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.430
You've still got lots of chances, Hayashi-san!

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:33.360
Y-Yeah!

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:38.860
All right, let's do this.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.870
8th: Experience Point Stone

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.240
Hey, Poko-chan.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.870
108th: Healing Potion

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.690
Hayashi-kun's a pretty good guy.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:53.880
6th: Fairy Bracelet

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:53.880
He is.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.880
He's a bit ingenuous,

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.840
and he gives his all even
to the smallest of quests.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:10:59.380
Yeah.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:03.730
I can understand why Lily-chan
wanted him to be her partner.

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:08.790
And it looks like Kanbe's
taken a liking to him, too.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:13.770
We haven't seen any top prizes yet.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:17.310
That greed sensor is way too sensitive!

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:23.230
Seriously. As soon as you want
something, it slips out of reach.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.790
I got two first prizes!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.870
If you sell that right away,
you'll make big bucks.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:36.800
I'll sell one and keep
the other as an heirloom!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.730
That's great, Hayashi-san!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.760
3rd: Flare Tunic

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.760
6th: Fairy Bracelet

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.300
I've got the full collection myself!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.300
2nd: Yggdrasil Series Skin

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.300
1st: Fairy Illusion

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.300
5th: Fairy Choker

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.300
4th: Fairy Headband

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.180
You look really cute!

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.140
Now we match!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:51.310
By the way, what were you gonna do
if you didn't get what you wanted?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.190
Huh?

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.550
What are you talking about?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.820
That would never happen.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.320
The type of person who keeps buying web
money until they get what they want!!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:07.810
But I think the color is too dark.
I'll have to dye it.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.590
I hope I can get it to a color like Li-chan's.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.420
I'm sure you'll get it in no time!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:16.210
Maybe I should have gone with
a more goth-loli kind of color.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.540
You do have that kind of image.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.630
Like dark purple or black.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.720
Pale colors like what you have on now

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.070
are more Lily's style.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.130
Really.

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:33.850
Changing your gear like that makes
you hard to recognize from afar.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.300
Besides, your character isn't
even the cutesy, fluffy type,

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.180
so it kinda feels wrong.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:42.740
K-Kanbe-san!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.580
Personally,

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.340
I think what you normally wear...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.650
Look! This is all because
you were mean to her!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:06.420
Now she's not wearing the gear
she went out of her way to win!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:08.840
Is that you, Himeralda?

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:12.630
Just because you're married doesn't mean you
should play each other's characters. It's freaky.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.020
Don't try to change the subject!

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.590
It's not like I was bullying her or anything.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:23.030
I just always end up saying whatever
I'm thinking when I'm around her.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:26.260
And I'm telling you to hold back a little!

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.870
That part of you is so childish.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:32.570
Speaking of, Li-chan, you aren't wearing
the gear you got the other day anymore?

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.160
It was cute. Really.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:37.930
Thanks!

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:41.300
But isn't this outfit more me?

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.680
I think what you normally wear

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.430
is more like you.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.490
I like it.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.910
Japanese Sweets
Anmitsu Arbor

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:19.420
I wonder how I can see Morioka-san again.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:23.920
You've really fallen for her, huh?

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:26.170
I told you, you've got it all wrong.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.930
That's not what I mean.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:29.760
Really?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.430
Because, Sakura-chan...

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:36.430
You're fidgety at work and keep
checking your phone for messages.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.480
I wonder if I said something
that made her hate me.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.570
I thought she'd agree if I came off as
being on the same wavelength as her.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.070
And after she turned you down for dinner,

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.840
I tried my best to sound
gentlemanly, but not too stiff.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.840
you were pretty in the dumps about it.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:49.200
Is that what she didn't like? No...

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:53.270
Welcome! You're having one of
our meals for dinner today, too?

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.570
I've just been so busy...

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.860
And recently, hoping you'd run into her again,

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:02.210
you've been visiting the convenience
store at different hours.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.840
Please stop!

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:07.590
The more you say, the more
it sounds like... Like I'm...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.140
A stalker or something!

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:13.100
You're not <i>like</i> a stalker. You really are one.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.220
Anyway!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:18.110
I have to find some other
reason to email her.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.680
Welcome.

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:00.620
Here you are.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.920
Thank you.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:05.980
Don't mention it.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:09.260
She had big ones.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:14.600
More than a handful for sure.
More and more! More and... Morimori-chan?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.420
Our eyes met!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.420
Did you come to buy a meal?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.810
Now he's talking to me!

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.870
Y-Yes.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:34.950
Me, too!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.460
Actually, I came to buy
something to eat, and look...

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:40.430
All I got were snacks.
I totally forgot about dinner.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.150
Is that right?

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.340
Acquaintances? Or is he hitting on her?

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.820
Convenience store meals are actually
pretty good these days, right?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.390
I can't decide what to get.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.200
Hey, any recommendations?

00:16:56.560 --> 00:17:00.070
Wh-Why is he still talking to me?

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.200
U-Uh...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:05.110
The egg over pork cutlet bowl is good.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.710
I already had a pork cutlet bowl for lunch.

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.750
Oh... I'm sorry.

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.980
It's just a personal favorite of mine,

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.720
but the Korean BBQ beef bowl is always tasty.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:20.850
I'm sorry.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.760
Hey, are you maybe...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.850
Morioka Moriko-san?

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.840
Y-Yes.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:30.360
Who is this guy?!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.020
It's me! Me!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.360
I used to call you lots
from the Tohoku branch.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:35.610
Koiwai!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.370
Wh-Wha?!

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.030
Koiwai-san!

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:49.590
I never thought I'd see
you here, Morimori-chan.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.090
What are you up to these days?

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.160
Uh, w-well...

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.340
I quit my job.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.850
I'm not working at the moment.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:05.350
Oh, yeah? Then you're the same as me.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:06.330
Huh?

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.840
Well, I found a new job after that.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.110
Oh, is that right?

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.850
Thinking back on it now,

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:18.860
I should have contacted
you when I quit back then.

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.510
Koiwai-san.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.370
I know!

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:25.480
We shouldn't waste this opportunity.
Let's go out for a few drinks!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:26.470
How about this weekend?

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.060
What?!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.360
What do I do?

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:33.380
I can't refuse now that
he knows I'm unemployed!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.400
Of course, it'll be my treat.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.960
If you're busy, we can go next week instead.

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.390
He's blocking off all my exits!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.600
Come on, we've got lots to catch up on.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.390
I know a great place we can go.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.050
Oh, do you drink?

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.430
Whereabouts do you live?

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.890
You'd rather go somewhere close, right?

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:54.850
Sakura-chan!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.240
Morioka Moriko

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.420
What could this be?

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.490
What? Hey, w-w-wait!

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.750
That's my phone!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.250
Huh?

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:13.750
Now why would Morimori-chan's
contact info be in my phone?

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.960
You stole it from my phone.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.260
Wrong!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.760
The correct answer is...

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.760
I'll send you all the info later,
so give me your email address.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.570
Oh, and give me your number, too,
just in case something comes up.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.020
Morioka Moriko

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:31.440
I had Morimori-chan put it in herself!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:33.310
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.440
And what's more...

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:36.440
Morimori-chan

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:38.940
said she'd go out on a date with me.

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:47.630
Lily-san!

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:49.960
Do you have a moment?

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.530
There's something I want to talk about.

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:56.200
Of course I have time for you.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.960
I'm your partner, remember?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:02.920
Lily-san's just so sweet.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.210
But how do I word this?

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:09.980
Hayashi is supposed to be a
healthy young man in university.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:20.110
Recently, all sorts of things keep
happening to me in real life.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.890
I feel like I'm being overrun.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.840
You might feel better after talking about it.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:26.960
I'm here for you.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:28.870
Thank you.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.150
Um, do you remember a while back
when we stayed up all night playing?

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:34.630
Oh, that did happen, didn't it?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.560
The next day, I fainted.

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.630
I ran into a woman on the street,

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.640
and when I came to,
I was in a hospital with an IV.

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:51.900
She asked me out to dinner as an apology,

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.490
but I turned her down.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.190
Why?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.400
I'm not good with that sort of thing.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.400
And yet...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.280
I just agreed to go out drinking
with someone else.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.280
Hm?

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:06.350
Well, about that...

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:08.720
I ran into someone at the convenience store

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.660
that I used to talk to over the phone!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.440
She used to help me out a lot, so I was happy.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:16.420
But it was a spur-of-the-moment thing.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.520
Before I knew it, I'd already agreed.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.790
Oh, this was someone I used to work with.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:24.840
Lily-san?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.230
Don't tell me...

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.900
No, there's no way.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.140
But if I think about everything he just said

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:41.700
and switch the genders around...

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:47.550
Characters in MMOs might not be
the same gender as their player.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.190
It happens a lot.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.490
So knowing that...

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:40.170
Next Episode

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:26.590
Are you okay?

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:28.670
I'm the one who's younger!

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:31.160
Are you making fun of my friends?

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:34.090
She's a NEET in her thirties
that plays a guy online.

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:36.320
You never know. It could be lip service.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.210
Episode 5
Secret Triangle

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:39.600
Episode 5, "Secret Triangle."
